    "description": "The regions with a serialized zonal topology, transmission links and technical parameters. Serialized from the live config in src/market_sim/config/iso_configs.py; re-serialize if iso_configs.py changes. _ISO_BUILDERS carries NINE registered regions at 2026-09-16 (ERCOT CAISO MISO PJM NYISO NEISO SPP NWPP SOCO) and all NINE are serialized here: SOCO's block was added by lane SOCO-34 on 2026-09-16, closing the debt NWPP-35 recorded in this field. Derived totals over the nine: 47 zones, 44 carrying load, 58 links. NWPP is a POOL of balancing authorities and SOCO is a SINGLE balancing authority (no LMP, no day-ahead market) — neither is an ISO, though every downstream name still says 'iso'. SOCO's voll of 61900.0 is not the 2000.0 the seven non-ERCOT ISOs carry: it is the LBNL/DOE ICE-Calculator-2 customer-mix derivation in _soco_config. SOCO's two links and its load shares are declared TIER-3 PLACEHOLDERS in iso_configs.py — the shares are an EIA-860 fleet-MW fallback, not a load share (lane SOCO-32 replaces them), and the TTCs are upper bounds that cannot bind (lever SOCO-54).",
